---
// Site logo: dark tile with a check mark, the site name and a year tag.
---
<span class="logo">
  <svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" /></svg>
  <span class="logo-name">Barrie Voter Guide</span>
  <span class="logo-year">2026</span>
</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; line-height: 1.1;
    background: #1d1d1b; color: #f3efe4; padding: .5rem .7rem .5rem .6rem; border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .logo { border-color: #3a3a36; }
  }
  .logo-mark { width: 1.35rem; height: 1.35rem; flex: none; }
  .logo-mark path { fill: none; stroke: #d6c08a; stroke-width: 3.2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .logo-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; letter-spacing: .01em; }
  .logo-year { background: #d6c08a; color: #1d1d1b; font-weight: 800; font-size: .72rem; padding: .2rem .4rem; border-radius: 5px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
</style>
